# Purpose: Deny by default: nothing is tracked unless it is allowed below, by
#          name (org ADR-0003), so every newly tracked file is a reviewed
#          choice, never an accident.
# Role: Git's ignore list, read by Git, and by markdownlint-cli2 to choose the
#       files it lints. A pull request that adds a file adds its line here too.
#       Git does not look inside an ignored folder, so each folder on the way
#       to an allowed file has a line of its own; that line allows no file by
#       itself. Within a group, lines are in git ls-files order, each folder
#       before its files. To see which line hides a file:
#       git check-ignore -v <path>

# Ignore everything.
**

# The allowlist itself, and the settings for Git, editors and markdownlint.
!/.editorconfig
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc

# The README, and the license and community files copied from the
# organization baseline.
!/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/SUPPORT.md

# GitHub settings and workflows.
!/.github/
!/.github/.config/
!/.github/.config/template-drift.lock
!/.github/.config/template-drift.yaml
!/.github/CODEOWNERS
!/.github/actionlint.yaml
!/.github/renovate.json5
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/workflows/build-images.yaml
!/.github/workflows/build-test-publish.yaml
!/.github/workflows/workflow-containers.yaml

# Documentation: the Diataxis folders, and the reference and explanation
# pages copied from the organization baseline.
!/docs/
!/docs/diagrams/
!/docs/diagrams/.gitkeep
!/docs/explanation/
!/docs/explanation/.gitkeep
!/docs/explanation/repo-type-taxonomy-and-ci-focus.md
